Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚已下度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn華文細黑\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 救救我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是那個人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.20,0:02:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都是 真是纏人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.80,0:02:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 已經決定不受理她的委託了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.30,0:02:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天又沒有回應
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.50,0:02:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.60,0:02:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再試一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 今天就算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.20,0:02:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.30,0:02:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子好餓哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在去喫點什麼吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.60,0:02:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 我在公司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待會兒見
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.50,0:03:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是能認識地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這所公司的收益很容易就能翻一倍了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.70,0:03:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不過那樣的話 你就要被免職了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天是早上開始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.40,0:03:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 我明天有期末考試
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要開董事會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.60,0:03:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美沙裏 你以爲自己是靠誰才能上學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.40,0:03:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦您了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.70,0:03:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.90,0:04:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}高塔上的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:22.50,0:04:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 在線商店Dead Line是海部裏穗社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.50,0:04:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在學生時代和幾個好友創辦的公司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:31.90,0:04:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然創業成員就剩下里穗社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.30,0:04:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但憑着社長豐富的電腦知識和經營才學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.00,0:04:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,僅用四年就發展爲這麼大的公司了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.20,0:04:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是位厲害人的物啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有職員都很尊敬她的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.60,0:04:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能相信嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只用四年哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.00,0:04:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧你說的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.10,0:04:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼說 就像我用了什麼歪門邪道似的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.30,0:05:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對沒有那個意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.40,0:05:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是新來的兼職人員
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫恩田
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請您多指教
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是社長海部裏穗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請多關照啊 恩田小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.50,0:05:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 就是因爲這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,綠通信社的M&A的計劃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.70,0:05:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲股東之一的綠川先生強硬反對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.00,0:05:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前情勢不容樂觀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.70,0:05:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請繼續努力與其進行交涉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.50,0:05:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我認爲他們怎麼都不會改變想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.30,0:05:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要不放棄的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.80,0:05:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神明總會降臨的哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.70,0:05:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至今爲止也就是如此
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.60,0:05:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼接下來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.60,0:05:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是擴充主機電腦一事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.70,0:05:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請參閱手邊的資料
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.20,0:05:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光通信也委託我公司擴充電腦 在各過程…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.80,0:05:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 裏穗社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.60,0:05:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,關於這個項目 社長是專家中的專家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.20,0:05:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就全部拜託社長您了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,榮幸之至
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.70,0:06:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,董事會淨是些蠢貨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.70,0:06:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要你來問我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女高中生樣貌的女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 剛纔在廁所前看到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.60,0:06:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 肯定是美沙裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:22.60,0:06:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浦野美沙裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說是裏穗社長的遠親
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.20,0:06:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶爾會在公司看到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浦野美沙裏吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:31.60,0:06:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,確實應該是在就讀高一或高二
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.30,0:06:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雙親已經去世
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏穗社長在照顧她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.30,0:06:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說是爲了學習社會經驗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.40,0:06:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而在這間公司打工
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.50,0:06:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.60,0:06:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然是社長的親戚 可電腦卻完全不行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.60,0:06:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以雖說是打工
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.20,0:06:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是打掃衛生倒茶什麼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.70,0:06:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後就是社長一個人加班時作作陪同
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.80,0:07:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.20,0:07:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有呢 裏穗社長以前的男友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.20,0:07:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 這個說過頭了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來是件不幸的消息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.60,0:07:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,綠川通信的原社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.30,0:07:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現爲第一大股東的綠川雷藏逝世
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.50,0:07:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鄙人綠川雷藏所有的綠川通信社股份中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.50,0:07:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,75%轉讓給Dead Line公司裏穗社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.30,0:07:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是做過頭了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.70,0:07:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.50,0:07:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 把這些輸入那個老頭的電腦裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.10,0:07:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,僞裝成是10天前寫的樣子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.20,0:07:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文件的屬性和註冊表會改好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.70,0:07:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後 建在哪個目錄下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些就交給你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.30,0:07:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至於什麼屬性怎麼樣 服務器怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.30,0:07:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全無法理解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.30,0:07:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是不明白那些懂電腦的人的想法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.90,0:08:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 到時間了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要更加偏激
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.80,0:08:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要消除怨恨的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.80,0:08:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要讓對方深信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是替人所爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就如小姐所估計的一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.30,0:08:28.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又沒反應
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女什麼的 不會根本就沒有吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.70,0:08:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美沙裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.70,0:08:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通過那個主頁揪出那個混蛋的真面目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這點小事 輕鬆搞定的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.00,0:08:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和偷盜新產品數據篡改帳戶餘額相比
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.90,0:08:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想做回在商店偷竊的少女嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那個意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.70,0:08:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前天社長說過後我試過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.20,0:08:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是對方反而突破了我們的防火牆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.60,0:08:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差點入侵到我們的電腦中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.10,0:08:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 我纔不管那麼多呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.40,0:09:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,商店偷盜的少女啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.60,0:09:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心不下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.60,0:09:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這家店是Dead Line的分公司嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我們的總公司啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.30,0:09:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前交往的女友經常在那打工
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.40,0:09:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 聽說那個公司只僱傭女性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兼職也全部都是女性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.10,0:09:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 現在是這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.70,0:09:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前公司也有像我一樣的男性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.60,0:09:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 公司的主力轉爲面向女性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:43.40,0:09:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男性就外派到關係公司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.80,0:09:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說白了就是降職
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.70,0:09:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也沒有重回總公司的可能性
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.00,0:09:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對了 我已經不能回到總公司了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.20,0:09:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 準沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,降職就是這個意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也回不去了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店長 請振作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.70,0:10:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷竊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.30,0:10:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店長的店應該也發生過吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.30,0:10:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 也是偶爾啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.70,0:10:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 大約一年前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有個奇怪的通告哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.80,0:10:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通告
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果發現店鋪小偷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.80,0:10:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在送去警察前先要和社長聯絡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.30,0:10:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之後 我這邊抓到的孩子是社長的親戚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:45.10,0:10:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社長的親戚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.80,0:10:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行不行 忘掉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.10,0:10:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當我剛纔沒說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.20,0:10:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 怎麼話說到這麼一半就不說了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏穗社長叫我不要說的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.00,0:11:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 你的話我也可以告訴你吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各種各樣的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.20,0:11:17.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這孩子 在公司貌似似乎對電腦一點都不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:17.50,0:11:19.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 據那個店長說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她似乎對電腦相當在行哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:22.10,0:11:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不僅自己可以配置電腦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.20,0:11:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至還能做黑客
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:26.50,0:11:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,與此相反
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社長卻不會電腦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:30.80,0:11:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊 已經知道了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.60,0:11:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看社長室中她們的對話就明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後還有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.30,0:11:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子和裏穗社長之間沒有親戚關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.70,0:11:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 是這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.50,0:11:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白天我調查過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.40,0:11:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,順便提一句
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.70,0:11:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾經一起開創公司的她的戀人對電腦很在行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:52.20,0:11:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然好像在公司發展起來之前就分手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.30,0:11:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:57.70,0:12:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因爲需要操作電腦的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.00,0:12:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後想到了利用商店小偷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.30,0:12:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不交給警察而將其作爲自己的幫手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.10,0:12:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然後上圈套的就是她啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.20,0:12:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯 就是這樣然後用不法手段逐漸將公司擴大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:40.70,0:12:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.80,0:12:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美沙裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.40,0:12:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔有個奇怪的男人打電話過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想要公司的祕密暴光的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.20,0:12:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要給他一億
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.10,0:12:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是黑客嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.30,0:12:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,調查這事情就是你的工作吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.60,0:12:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽到了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我上班之前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對要查清那人的真面目
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.70,0:13:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種時間就開始工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.40,0:13:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,頭好痛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.60,0:13:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宿醉真難過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.40,0:13:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是昨天拜託我的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.50,0:13:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶爾去上上學吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.80,0:13:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.70,0:13:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.70,0:13:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女的事就先放一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.40,0:13:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣連續熬夜下去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.20,0:13:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對皮膚不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:42.90,0:13:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所發現的屍體是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.60,0:14:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小林徹 33歲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.90,0:14:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,經營電腦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.80,0:14:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目標是小林徹 33歲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.80,0:14:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用什麼方法就看你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.60,0:14:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,儘快幹掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.80,0:14:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下總算
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.60,0:14:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總算怎樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.70,0:14:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這下總算能讓警察逮捕我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:30.90,0:14:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追究其他罪行的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.50,0:14:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,殺死你父親的證據也會出現
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.00,0:14:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父女兩還真是像啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一樣擅長電腦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:44.00,0:14:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還有之後的命運也是一樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.80,0:14:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的父親也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.90,0:14:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以放過他性騷擾的事件爲條件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.90,0:14:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而使喚他來幫我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然他是被冤枉的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.30,0:15:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是在他受不住良心責備想向警察告密時
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就從這個世界上消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.00,0:15:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找出這家公司費了不少勁吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.40,0:15:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在這裏可是機密哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.00,0:15:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浦野
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.40,0:15:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 田村美沙裏小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.20,0:15:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然我不會操作電腦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:31.50,0:15:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上有一種叫偵探的便利職業哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹掉田村後爲難的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.90,0:15:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好你出現了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.50,0:15:43.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就覺得這裏面有些蹊蹺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.60,0:15:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,於是僱了偵探來調查你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.60,0:15:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偷東西被抓是你故意的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.50,0:15:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了混入這個公司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:56.10,0:16:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑客侵入也是爲了抓住我的把柄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.70,0:16:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 實在是遺憾 你反被我將了一軍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的行動全被看穿了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.70,0:16:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有 有人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.30,0:16:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒用的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.20,0:16:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警衛剛纔已被這傢伙收拾掉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.30,0:16:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人的性命難道不值一提嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.00,0:16:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是殺一個和殺幾個都一樣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是這樣把公司搞大的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.30,0:16:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你絕對會下地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.70,0:16:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是幾十年後的事了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.00,0:16:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生說到底就是場遊戲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.60,0:16:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遊戲結束前享樂的人就是贏家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.50,0:16:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別讓她跑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.10,0:16:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是有這種事 所以纔想用地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.50,0:16:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男人在關鍵時刻總是不管用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.70,0:17:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,12點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.60,0:17:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:15.30,0:17:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 殺了海部吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:19.70,0:17:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:32.10,0:17:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:34.20,0:17:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.40,0:17:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.30,0:17:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.70,0:17:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:47.40,0:17:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.00,0:17:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.50,0:17:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.50,0:17:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:01.50,0:18:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是立刻吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:02.90,0:18:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是幾十年之後吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.80,0:18:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.60,0:18:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:12.60,0:18:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.40,0:18:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死後 你的靈魂將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.00,0:18:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個世界纔是地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:20.90,0:18:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要那個人還活着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.70,0:18:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:33.60,0:18:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解決了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.70,0:18:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少回個話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這裏是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.80,0:18:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Dead Line公司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.70,0:18:56.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對了 我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.80,0:19:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,健二 硬盤是這個吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.80,0:19:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是的 裏穗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.50,0:19:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是有原因的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死 死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.60,0:19:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏穗 你幹了什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.20,0:19:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼能讓你們把我的人生弄得一團糟呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.70,0:19:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,託你們的福我覺悟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.80,0:19:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管用什麼手段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都要贏得人生的遊戲給所有人看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.20,0:19:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕犧牲掉所有人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.10,0:19:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一個就是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:53.80,0:19:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一個犧牲掉的就是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來就輪到你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.40,0:20:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 社長
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這種地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.90,0:20:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在這種地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.00,0:20:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄的入口
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.20,0:20:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是說過輪到你了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.70,0:20:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.60,0:20:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傷害鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:33.10,0:20:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.40,0:20:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.60,0:20:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我必須屢次被殺啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:57.60,0:20:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是屢次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.60,0:21:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是永遠啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:06.60,0:21:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨 將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:20.60,0:21:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 聽說了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:22.00,0:21:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天被抓住的暴徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.60,0:21:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說自己殺了警衛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.60,0:21:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是警衛老伯不是生龍活虎嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是說嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.40,0:21:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人是不是在做夢啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:33.60,0:21:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過 夢幻破滅呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:35.40,0:21:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,裏穗社長對於電腦竟然一竅不通
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:38.60,0:21:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽說社長的工作全部是美沙裏在做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:42.70,0:21:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且她今天開始住進了裏穗社長用過的公寓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.90,0:21:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您在跟誰說話啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.60,0:21:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在和誰說話呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:53.40,0:21:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也聽到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.20,0:21:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦您了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:57.80,0:21:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎樣啊 白領的生活
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.10,0:22:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是不合適啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:01.80,0:22:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直坐在桌子前面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:07.70,0:22:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.60,0:22:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了的話 一定會下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.20,0:22:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那可是幾十年後的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.90,0:22:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人生說到底就是場遊戲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.50,0:22:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遊戲結束前享樂的人就是贏家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:43.50,0:22:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 也是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.90,0:22:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就讓我盡情享受這場遊戲吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.60,0:23:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.40,0:23:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.90,0:23:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て　{\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.80,0:23:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ　{\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ　{\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:45.90,0:23:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.70,0:23:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.70,0:24:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.70,0:24:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.45,0:24:32.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.00,0:24:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.70,0:24:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安田遙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.40,0:24:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨他嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.30,0:24:42.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一天 在窗口看到了這番情景
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:42.60,0:24:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,母親 好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.20,0:24:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也看不下去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.80,0:24:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.50,0:24:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把那傢伙流放到地獄去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.50,0:24:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.80,0:25:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.80,0:25:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}午後的窗口
